@startuml 11-seq-consultar-extrato-professor
' KarvCoins — Sequência UC-EXT-PROF: Consultar Extrato (Professor)
' Visão caixa-branca: Professor ↔ SPA ↔ JwtFilter ↔ ProfessorController ↔ ProfessorService ↔
'   ExtratoService ↔ ProfessorRepository ↔ TransacaoRepository ↔ DB

title Sequência de Realização — UC-EXT-PROF: Consultar Extrato (Professor)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E1
  BorderColor #B7791F
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1565C0
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
  BorderColor #2E7D32
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F3F4F6
  BorderColor #9E9E9E
}

actor "Professor" as PR
participant ":SPA Angular" as SPA
participant ":JwtFilter\n(Spring Security)" as JWT
participant ":ProfessorController" as ProfCtrl
participant ":ProfessorService" as ProfSvc
participant ":ExtratoService" as ExtratoSvc
participant ":ProfessorRepository" as ProfRepo
participant ":TransacaoRepository" as TrRepo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Carregar saldo atual ==

PR -> SPA : acessar extrato
SPA -> JWT : GET /api/karv-coins/professores/me/resumo\n(Authorization: Bearer token)
activate JWT
JWT -> JWT : validarToken() — extrairPrincipal()
JWT -> ProfCtrl : getResumoMe(Principal)
activate ProfCtrl
ProfCtrl -> ProfSvc : getResumoMe(professorId)
activate ProfSvc
ProfSvc -> ProfRepo : findById(professorId)
activate ProfRepo
ProfRepo -> DB : SELECT * FROM professores p\nJOIN usuarios u ON p.id=u.id WHERE p.id=?
DB --> ProfRepo : row
ProfRepo --> ProfSvc : Professor
deactivate ProfRepo
ProfSvc --> ProfCtrl : ProfessorResumoDTO {nome, departamento, saldo}
deactivate ProfSvc
ProfCtrl --> JWT : 200 OK + ProfessorResumoDTO
deactivate ProfCtrl
JWT --> SPA : 200 OK + JSON
deactivate JWT
SPA --> PR : exibir saldo atual

== Carregar histórico de envios ==

SPA -> JWT : GET /api/karv-coins/professores/me/extrato\n(Authorization: Bearer token)
activate JWT
JWT -> JWT : validarToken() — extrairPrincipal()
JWT -> ProfCtrl : getExtratoMe(Principal)
activate ProfCtrl
ProfCtrl -> ExtratoSvc : getExtratoProfessor(professorId)
activate ExtratoSvc

ExtratoSvc -> TrRepo : findByProfessorId(professorId)
activate TrRepo
TrRepo -> DB : SELECT t.*, a.nome AS aluno_nome\nFROM transacoes t\nJOIN alunos a ON t.aluno_id=a.id\nWHERE t.professor_id=? ORDER BY t.data DESC
DB --> TrRepo : rows (envios de moedas)
TrRepo --> ExtratoSvc : List<Transacao>
deactivate TrRepo

note right of ExtratoSvc
  Cada item do extrato inclui:
  data, aluno beneficiado, valor
  e motivo do reconhecimento.
end note

ExtratoSvc --> ProfCtrl : List<ExtratoItemDTO>\n{data, aluno, valor, motivo}
deactivate ExtratoSvc
ProfCtrl --> JWT : 200 OK + List
deactivate ProfCtrl
JWT --> SPA : 200 OK + JSON
deactivate JWT
SPA --> PR : exibir histórico de moedas enviadas

@enduml
